Read AGENTS.md in the root directory and all files in AGENTS/ before any task.
These files contain the complete codebase context for this Angular 19 + Nx monorepo.

## Architecture
4-layer system: App Shell → Feature Modules → Shared Libraries → Nuxeo Server
Features never import from other features (Nx boundary rule enforced by lint).

## Non-negotiable conventions
- standalone: true on every component — no NgModules anywhere
- inject() for all dependency injection — never constructor parameters
- signal() for all mutable state — no BehaviorSubject for UI state
- computed() for derived state — no redundant recalculation
- takeUntilDestroyed() on every .subscribe() call — no manual unsubscribe
- templateUrl always — no inline templates
- Never <img [src]="nuxeoUrl"> — fetch via DocumentDetailService, use blob URL
- Never fetch() for Nuxeo calls — use NuxeoApiBase (HttpClient interceptor handles auth)
- Never cross-feature imports — shared code goes in libs/shared/
- Never hardcode credentials — use process.env and validate at startup

## Where things live
- New service method → libs/shared/nuxeo-client/src/lib/services/<domain>.service.ts
- New shared component → libs/shared/ui/src/lib/<name>/
- New feature page → libs/features/<feature>/src/lib/<feature>/<feature>.ts
- New AI endpoint → apps/ai-backend/src/routes/<name>.route.ts
- Routing → apps/nuxeo-ui/src/app/app.routes.ts
- Auth → apps/nuxeo-ui/src/app/auth/

## Definition of done
npx nx affected -t lint && npx nx affected -t build && npx nx affected -t test
Unit tests required for every new service method.
PR on feature/* or fix/* branch — never commit directly to main.
